Throwback to EthCC in Paris in 2022, Vitalik Buterin called Ethereum Classic “the original Ethereum” and told the room: “If you like Proof of Work, you should go use Ethereum Classic. It’s a totally fine chain.”

Four years later, it’s still running.🍀